<title>USA: Caspian names Williams global position trader.</title>
<headline>Caspian names Williams global position trader.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said Friday Derrick Williams had joined the firm as senior global position trader.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Williams joined Caspian from Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc, where he was senior trader in international equities.</p>
<p>Before that he worked for Merrill Lynch and Co Inc for 14 years, trading in all international markets.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
